            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 136764,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-Shop-Recipe-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "First, you should place the Basic Crafting Table in your dorm room or castle. Your first assignment is to make two Daggers of Absolution. You should have no difficulty.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_WCShopKeepF_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/EudoraTangletree_QST_11.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 136764,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-Shop-Recipe-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "You'll need to buy a recipe from me, and then gather the required ingredients. When you've got all your ingredients, use your Basic Crafting Table to make the athames.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Human_WCShopKeepF_E_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/EudoraTangletree_QST_12.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 136764,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WC-Shop-Recipe-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "When you have made two Daggers of Absolution, bring them back to me and I'll award you a Novice Crafter badge. So remember to bring them here when you're finished. Good luck! I can't wait to see them!",
